OL,3,GNEWSABoy who changed law on medicinal
OL,4,Acannabis thriving as he turns 21
OL,5,
OL,6,FTurning 21 is a milestone for most.
OL,8,FFor Charlotte Caldwell, celebrating her
OL,9,Fson Billy's 21st birthday was something
OL,10,Fshe feared would never happen.
OL,12,FBilly Caldwell, from Castlederg in
OL,13,FCounty Tyrone, has a severe form of
OL,14,Fepilepsy, which at one point had him
OL,15,Fsuffering hundreds of
OL,16,F"life-threatening" seizures a day.
OL,18,FAfter a legal battle, Billy was
OL,19,Fprescribed a cannabis-based medicine
OL,20,Fwhich stopped his seizures.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
